B.bbI=new A.mB("Hardy clans","Your levies fight 35% harder, and hills and forests never slow your attacks.")
B.bbJ=new A.mB("The great levy","Every Mercian province musters 30% more levies.")
B.bbK=new A.mB("Sea kings","A host with longships can sail from the coast to attack or land on any coast within reach.")
B.bbL=new A.mB("Mountain fastness","Your hosts and levies fight 30% harder defending Welsh land.")
B.bbM=new A.mB("Northern fury","Your hosts fight 15% harder when they attack.")
B.bbN=new A.mB("Danegeld","Demand gold from a realm you are at war with \u2014 if it fears you, it pays for peace. Your hosts live off the land, and ships carry them to any coast within reach.")
